(87, 42, 'USER', 'What is Python?', NULL, '2026-11-02 04:34:20'),
(88, 42, 'AI', '**Python** is a high-level, interpreted, dynamically-typed programming language renowned for its clean syntax, readability, and versatile standard library.\n\n• **Key Characteristics**: Easy to learn, cross-platform, supports object-oriented, functional, and procedural paradigms.\n• **Primary Use Cases**: Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning (PyTorch, TensorFlow, Scikit-Learn), Web Development (Django, FastAPI, Flask), Data Analysis (Pandas, NumPy), and Automation/Scripting.\n• **Ecosystem**: Backed by a vast package repository (PyPI) and an active global developer community.', NULL, '2026-11-02 04:34:20'),
